{"ui_id":"u_000001_01","response_id":"r_000001_01","query_id":"q_000001","intent":"Booking","tags":["flight","booking","comparison","actions"],"intent_bucket":"booking","response_text":"# Bengaluru to Tokyo: Business Flight Comparison\n\nFor your business trip on June 18, 2026, the **Air India** non-stop flight is the top recommendation, offering the fastest travel time and maximizing your time in Tokyo. For a more premium experience, **Cathay Pacific** is a strong alternative with a similarly short duration and lounge eligibility. The other options provide cost savings but at the expense of significantly longer journeys.\n\n# Flight Details Context\n\nThis comparison is based on the fixed flight offer data provided for one-way travel from Bengaluru (BLR) to Tokyo Haneda (HND) on the specified date. Fares and availability are subject to change.\n\n# Flight Options Table: BLR to HND\nMedia: Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/table.svg\n- **Airline:** Air India\n- **Departure:** 01:20 AM\n- **Arrival:** 01:35 PM\n- **Duration:** 8h 45m\n- **Stops:** Non-stop\n- **Fare:** ₹42,800\n\n- **Airline:** Cathay Pacific\n- **Departure:** 01:25 AM\n- **Arrival:** 12:45 PM\n- **Duration:** 8h 50m\n- **Stops:** 1 stop\n- **Fare:** ₹45,600\n\n- **Airline:** Thai Airways\n- **Departure:** 00:30 AM\n- **Arrival:** 03:40 PM\n- **Duration:** 11h 40m\n- **Stops:** 1 stop\n- **Fare:** ₹41,200\n\n- **Airline:** Singapore Airlines\n- **Departure:** 11:35 AM\n- **Arrival:** 08:10 AM (+1d)\n- **Duration:** 17h 05m\n- **Stops:** 1 stop\n- **Fare:** ₹38,900\n\n# Ranked Recommendations\n\n### #1: Air India (AI392)\nMedia: Image=https://www.airbus.com/sites/g/files/jlcbta136/files/2023-01/Air%20India%20A350-900.jpg Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/airplane.svg\n- **Duration:** 8h 45m\n- **Stops:** Non-stop\n- **Fare:** **₹42,800**\n- **Business Value:** The most efficient option. This direct flight minimizes travel time, allowing for a full afternoon and evening in Tokyo upon arrival. Includes carry-on baggage.\n\n### #2: Cathay Pacific (CX624/CX542)\nMedia: Image=https://www.cathaypacific.com/content/dam/cx/about-us/press-room/images/CX_A350-1000_B-LXI_20180619.jpg Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/airplane.svg\n- **Duration:** 8h 50m\n- **Stops:** 1 stop (HKG)\n- **Fare:** **₹45,600**\n- **Business Value:** Excellent for comfort. Despite one stop, the travel time is nearly as short as the direct flight. Lounge eligibility adds a premium touch for a productive layover.\n\n### #3: Thai Airways (TG326/TG660)\nMedia: Image=https://www.thaiairways.com/static/common/imgscontent/news/A350-Royal-First-Class-01.jpg Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/airplane.svg\n- **Duration:** 11h 40m\n- **Stops:** 1 stop (BKK)\n- **Fare:** **₹41,200**\n- **Business Value:** A cost-effective choice with a reasonable travel time. The inclusion of a checked bag is a practical benefit, and the fare is lower than the fastest options.\n\n### #4: Singapore Airlines (SQ509/SQ632)\nMedia: Image=https://www.singaporeair.com/saar5/images/flying-withus/our-fleet/a380/a380-exterior-full.jpg Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/airplane.svg\n- **Duration:** 17h 05m\n- **Stops:** 1 stop (SIN)\n- **Fare:** **₹38,900**\n- **Business Value:** The most budget-friendly option. Best suited for travelers who are not time-sensitive, as the overnight layover and next-day arrival significantly extend the journey. Includes a meal service.\n\n# Quick Actions\nAction: [Button: Search Flights on Kayak] https://www.kayak.co.in/flights/Bengaluru-BLR-Tokyo-HND/2026-06-18?sort=best\nAction: [Button: Set Fare Alert on Google] https://www.google.com/travel/flights\n\n# Sources\n- Flight Data: User-provided offer details for June 18, 2026.\n\nIcons:\n- Airplane: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/airplane.svg\n- Bag Check: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/bag-check.svg","genui_json":{"root":"root","state":{"flightData":[{"airline":"Air India","departure":"01:20 AM","arrival":"01:35 PM","duration":"8h 45m","stops":"Non-stop","fare":"₹42,800"},{"airline":"Cathay Pacific","departure":"01:25 AM","arrival":"12:45 PM","duration":"8h 50m","stops":"1 stop","fare":"₹45,600"},{"airline":"Thai Airways","departure":"00:30 AM","arrival":"03:40 PM","duration":"11h 40m","stops":"1 stop","fare":"₹41,200"},{"airline":"Singapore Airlines","departure":"11:35 AM","arrival":"08:10 AM (+1d)","duration":"17h 05m","stops":"1 stop","fare":"₹38,900"}]},"elements":{"root":{"type":"Stack","props":{"direction":"vertical","gap":"lg"},"children":["mainTitle","summaryCard","contextCard","tableSection","recommendationsSection","actionsSection","sourcesSection"]},"mainTitle":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Bengaluru to Tokyo: Business Flight Comparison","variant":"h2"},"children":[]},"summaryCard":{"type":"Card","props":{},"children":["summaryText"]},"summaryText":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"For your business trip on June 18, 2026, the Air India non-stop flight is the top recommendation, offering the fastest travel time. For a more premium experience, Cathay Pacific is a strong alternative with a similarly short duration. The other options provide cost savings but at the expense of significantly longer journeys."},"children":[]},"contextCard":{"type":"Card","props":{},"children":["contextTitle","contextText"]},"contextTitle":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Flight Details Context","variant":"h3"},"children":[]},"contextText":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"This comparison is based on the fixed flight offer data provided for one-way travel from Bengaluru (BLR) to Tokyo Haneda (HND) on the specified date. Fares and availability are subject to change."},"children":[]},"tableSection":{"type":"Stack","props":{"direction":"vertical","gap":"md"},"children":["tableTitleStack","flightTable"]},"tableTitleStack":{"type":"Stack"