{"ui_id":"u_000002_01","response_id":"r_000002_01","query_id":"q_000002","intent":"weather","tags":["weather","forecast","local","table"],"intent_bucket":"weather","response_text":"# Seattle Outdoor Planner: Saturday, May 16\n\n## Weather Overview & Forecast\nMedia: Image=https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51234901923_1833883626_b.jpg Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/cloud-sun.svg\n**59°F** and **Partly Cloudy**. Feels like **57°F**.\n- **Humidity:** 68%\n- **Wind:** 9 mph from West\n- **UV Index:** 5 (Moderate)\n- **Sunrise:** 5:29 AM | **Sunset:** 8:41 PM\n\n### Hourly Outlook\n- **8 AM:** 55°F, Partly Cloudy, 10% Rain Chance\n- **11 AM:** 61°F, Sun Breaks, 10% Rain Chance\n- **2 PM:** 66°F, Partly Sunny, 15% Rain Chance\n- **5 PM:** 64°F, Breezy, 20% Rain Chance\n- **8 PM:** 58°F, Cloudy, 30% Rain Chance\n\n## Activity Recommendations\nThe best window for outdoor activities is late morning to early afternoon, with peak temperatures and the lowest chance of rain. Conditions will become breezier with a higher rain risk later in the day.\n\n### **High Recommendation: Afternoon Walk**\nMedia: Image=https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51245663223_32717834b6_b.jpg Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/tree.svg\nA walk is ideal between 11 AM and 3 PM. You'll catch the day's warmest temperatures and best chance of sun. Consider Discovery Park or the waterfront for scenic views.\n\n### **Safe Alternative: Museum Visit**\nMedia: Image=https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52678688922_012b18b456_b.jpg Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/building.svg\nA museum visit is an excellent all-weather choice. This is the best option if your plans extend into the evening when rain becomes more likely.\n\n### **Not Recommended: Picnic**\nMedia: Image=https://live.staticflickr.com/4023/4652250275_9e6753a876_b.jpg Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/wind.svg\nA picnic is risky. The increasing chance of rain (up to 30% by evening) and breezy conditions, especially after 5 PM, make it an unreliable choice for the day.\n\n## Quick Actions\nAction: [Button: Find Seattle Parks] https://www.seattle.gov/parks/allparks\nAction: [Button: Explore Seattle Museums] https://www.visitseattle.org/things-to-do/arts-culture/museums/\n\n## Sources\n- Weather Forecast Data: https://www.weather.gov/\n\nIcons:\n- Alarm: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/alarm.svg\n- Camera: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/camera.svg","genui_json":{"root":"root","state":{"weatherMetrics":[{"metric":"Humidity","value":"68%"},{"metric":"Wind","value":"9 mph from West"},{"metric":"UV Index","value":"5 (Moderate)"},{"metric":"Sunrise","value":"5:29 AM"},{"metric":"Sunset","value":"8:41 PM"}],"hourlyForecast":[{"time":"8 AM","temp":"55°F","condition":"Partly Cloudy","rain_chance":"10% Rain Chance"},{"time":"11 AM","temp":"61°F","condition":"Sun Breaks","rain_chance":"10% Rain Chance"},{"time":"2 PM","temp":"66°F","condition":"Partly Sunny","rain_chance":"15% Rain Chance"},{"time":"5 PM","temp":"64°F","condition":"Breezy","rain_chance":"20% Rain Chance"},{"time":"8 PM","temp":"58°F","condition":"Cloudy","rain_chance":"30% Rain Chance"}]},"elements":{"root":{"type":"Stack","props":{"direction":"vertical","gap":"lg","padding":16},"children":["title","weather_card","recommendations_title","recommendations_summary","recommendations_stack","actions_title","actions_stack","sources_title","sources_button"]},"title":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Seattle Outdoor Planner: Saturday, May 16","variant":"h2"},"children":[]},"weather_card":{"type":"Card","props":{},"children":["weather_stack"]},"weather_stack":{"type":"Stack","props":{"direction":"vertical","gap":"md","padding":16},"children":["weather_title","weather_image","current_weather_stack","feels_like_text","weather_metrics_table","hourly_title","hourly_table"]},"weather_title":{"type":"Tex