{"ui_id":"u_000007_01","response_id":"r_000007_01","query_id":"q_000007","intent":"data visualisation","tags":["analytics","sales","kpi","table"],"intent_bucket":"data_visualization","response_text":"# Weekly Sales Performance Snapshot\nMedia: Image=https://loremflickr.com/1200/800/cafe,coffee Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/graph-up.svg\n- **Total Units Sold**: 1,107\n- **Best Selling Item**: Masala Chai (300 units)\n- **Busiest Day**: Friday (278 units)\n\n# Item Sales & Growth Analysis\nThis table details the performance of each item, highlighting total sales and growth from Monday to Friday.\n\n- **Masala Chai**\n  - Category: Hot\n  - Total Sales: **300**\n  - Mon-Fri Growth: **+18.2%**\n\n- **Iced Latte**\n  - Category: Cold\n  - Total Sales: **255**\n  - Mon-Fri Growth: **+84.2%**\n\n- **Espresso**\n  - Category: Hot\n  - Total Sales: **221**\n  - Mon-Fri Growth: **+21.4%**\n\n- **Sandwich**\n  - Category: Food\n  - Total Sales: **171**\n  - Mon-Fri Growth: **+46.7%**\n\n- **Cold Brew**\n  - Category: Cold\n  - Total Sales: **160**\n  - Mon-Fri Growth: **+118.2%**\n\n# Category Performance Trends\n- **Cold Drinks:** This category demonstrated explosive growth, with sales nearly doubling from Monday to Friday. It is the primary driver of late-week revenue increases.\n- **Hot Drinks:** Provided a consistent, high-volume sales base throughout the week, showing steady but modest growth. Masala Chai is the top-selling item overall.\n- **Food:** Sales grew moderately through the week but lagged significantly behind beverage sales, indicating a clear opportunity for targeted promotions.\n\n# Operational Recommendations\nHere are three actionable insights based on the weekly sales data.\n\n### 1. Capitalize on Cold Drink Demand\nMedia: Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/snow.svg\nThe dramatic late-week spike in Iced Latte and Cold Brew sales requires proactive preparation. Increase stock of ice, milk, and cold brew concentrate for Thursdays and Fridays. Consider rostering an extra staff member for the Friday afternoon shift to manage the rush and maintain service speed.\n\n### 2. Boost Food Sales with Pairings\nMedia: Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/plus-circle-dotted.svg\nTo lift underperforming food sales, introduce a \"combo deal.\" Offer a discount on a sandwich when purchased with a high-growth cold drink. This can convert beverage-only customers into higher-value meal customers, especially on Thursday and Friday.\n\n### 3. Investigate the Tuesday Slowdown\nMedia: Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/search.svg\nTuesday was the slowest growth day and saw a dip in sales for both Espresso and Sandwiches. Analyze potential causes for this anomaly. Review local business schedules, competitor promotions, or internal factors like staffing to understand and address the dip.\n\nIcons:\n- Airplane: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/airplane.svg\n- Alarm: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/alarm.svg","genui_json":{"root":"root","state":{"salesData":[{"id":"1","item":"Masala Chai","category":"Hot","sales":"300","growth":"+18.2%"},{"id":"2","item":"Iced Latte","category":"Cold","sales":"255","growth":"+84.2%"},{"id":"3","item":"Espresso","category":"Hot","sales":"221","growth":"+21.4%"},{"id":"4","item":"Sandwich","category":"Food","sales":"171","growth":"+46.7%"},{"id":"5","item":"Cold Brew","category":"Cold","sales":"160","growth":"+118.2%"}]},"elements":{"root":{"type":"Stack","props":{"direction":"vertical","gap":"lg"},"children":["header_stack","hero_image","summary_card","analysis_section","trends_section","recommendations_section"]},"header_stack":{"type":"Stack","props":{"direction":"horizontal","align":"center","gap":"md"},"children":["header_icon","header_title"]},"header_icon":{"type":"Icon","props":{"name":"../assets/r_000007_01_2_graph-up.svg"},"children":[]},"header_title":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Weekly Sales Performance Snapshot","variant":"h2"},"children":[]},"hero_image":{"type":"Image","props":{"url":"../assets/r_000007_01_1_cafe_coffee.jpg","fit":"cover"},"children":[]},"summary_card":{"type":"Card","props":{},"children":["summary_stack"]},"summary_stack":{"type":"Stack","props":{"direction":"vertical","gap":"sm","padding":"md"},"children":["kpi_total_units","kpi_best_item","kpi_busiest_day"]},"kpi_total_units":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Total Units Sold: 1,107","variant":"body"},"children":[]},"kpi_best_item":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Best Selling Item: Masala Chai (300 units)","variant":"body"},"children":[]},"kpi_busiest_day":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Busiest Day: Friday (278 units)","variant":"body"},"children":[]},"analysis_section":{"type":"Stack","props":{"direction":"vertical","gap":"md"},"children":["analysis_title","analysis_desc","sales_table"]},"analysis_title":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Item Sales & Growth Analysis","variant":"h2"},"children":[]},"analysis_desc":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"This table details the performance of each item, highlighting total sales and growth from Monday to Friday.","variant":"body"},"children":[]},"sales_table":{"type":"Table","props":{"columns":[{"key":"item","label":"Item"},{"key":"category","label":"Category"},{"key":"sales","label":"Total Sales"},{"key":"growth","label":"Mon-Fri Growth"}],"statePath":"/salesData","domain":"generic","preferredPresentation":"table"},"children":[]},"trends_section":{"type":"Stack","props":{"direction":"vertical","gap":"md"},"children":["trends_title","trends_card"]},"trends_title":{"type":"Text","props":{"text":"Category Performance Trends","variant":"h2"},"children":[]},"trends_card":{"type":"Card","props":{},"children":["trends_stack"]},"trends_stack":{"type":"Stack","props":{"direction":"vertical","gap":"md","padding":"md"},"children":["trend_cold_stack","trend_hot_stack","trend_food_stack"]},"trend_co